let __v_199 = Value::from("There is no right number, only a price: each guest costs roughly £100 to £150 at a catered wedding, so 100 guests is a £10,000 to £15,000 decision. Write two lists - the people you would be sad not to see, then everyone else - and cut from the second until the money works. The room is the other hard limit, because a seated meal needs about 1.2 square metres a head, and children count towards both.");
