let __v_266 = Value::from("Give the evening a shape rather than waiting for an idea: one thing you will actually do at 8pm (a film you have been meaning to watch, a walk before it gets dark, a call to someone you like), tea that takes a bit of effort, and the phone in another room for the first hour. A free evening feels long when nothing is decided and short when one thing is.");
