let __v_267 = Value::from("Three things, one each: something out of the house (a walk you have not done, a park, the library, a free museum), one job you keep putting off but that takes an hour (the drawer, the bike, the photos), and one thing with a person - a call, a walk with someone, a coffee. Put the outdoor one on the better day and keep Sunday evening free, or the weekend ends in a rush and feels like it never happened.");
