let __v_821 = Value::from("Count the people first, because it decides the room and the food: 8 to 12 is easy to cook for at home, 30 to 40 is about as many as a house takes, and a pub's back room or a restaurant takes 20 to 60 for a similar price to a hall. Pick the day and send one message with the date, time, place and whether it is a meal or drinks, because \"let me know if you can make it\" gets half-answers. Keep the food to things made the day before - a pie or a chilli kept warm, a baked ham, bread, two salads and a bought cake - and give two people one job each, drinks and cards and the speech, so you are not doing all of it. Send the invitations three to four weeks ahead, six for a big do or a date near Christmas, and ask for replies by a date a week before. Budget £10 to £15 a head for a buffet at home and £25 to £40 in a restaurant's back room, drink on top.");
